---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"choom\")"
---
Display and adjust OOM-killer score

Usage: choom [options] -p pid
       choom [options] -n number -p pid
       choom [options] -n number [--] command [args...]

Arguments:
  [COMMAND]...  Command and arguments to run with adjusted OOM score

Options:
  -n, --adjust <num>  OOM score adjust value to set (-1000 to 1000)
  -p, --pid <num>     Process ID to display or adjust
  -h, --help          Print help
